<HEAD>PART 13&#x2014;ESTABLISHING PAID SICK LEAVE FOR FEDERAL CONTRACTORS
</HEAD>
<AUTH>
<HED>Authority:</HED><PSPACE>5 U.S.C. 301; E.O. 13706, 80 FR 54697, 3 CFR, 2016 Comp., p. 367; Secretary's Order 01-2014, 79 FR 77527.
</PSPACE></AUTH>
